# DB snapshot PDFs (may contain PHI) — keep these out of git
output/*.pdf
output/**/*.pdf

# Scratch output of scripts/export-container-images.sh (its default OUTPUT_DIR).
# Root-anchored on purpose: output/container-images/ is the COMMITTED bundle
# (tars via Git LFS) that air-gapped hosts pull with `airgap-cli cron-update`.
# An unanchored `container-images/` also matched output/container-images/, which
# silently dropped newly added bundle files (e.g. airgap-cli) from commits.
/container-images/

